{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b9c92ce0dc0e635dfcbc4fe84206d346318ad80ce14205559770ad9a211d434", "ja": "（琴葉達がゲームの世界でライブをする事になった。\nステージの準備のため、一緒に買い出しに来ている）", "zh": "（琴叶她们要在游戏世界里举办演唱会。为了准备舞台，正在一起出来采购。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "253f63be12cd6c6db0cd73436b143b48e5bdd82083a01e74cdfe6efaa3c5be78", "ja": "{$P$}、どうですか？\nゲームの中って言われても、わからないですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么样？\n就算说这是游戏里，也分辨不出来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a1a98a0ac5a5bd364f2af0e8807b34b5e30da3e54556bb61a5ed478a63de92a8", "ja": "ああ、こうして改めて町を眺めると、\n本当にそう思うよ。凄いリアリティだよな……。", "zh": "啊，像这样重新眺望这座城镇，\n确实会这么觉得。真实感真强啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "4da3827e9916d66db00e217be6e727c1068a9159b8e3029d3cf463bc0bef0e04", "ja": "そうなんです。色々とできることも多くて。\nこれならライブもきっと……あ、そうだ！", "zh": "没错，能做的事情也很多。  \n这样一来，演唱会一定也能……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "913e9efa6746bb4f94bafbe4b24910a3ed1f04925690ed6059eb39a1cefc5ecf", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっと商店街に寄らせて\nもらってもいいですか？　食材を買いたくて。", "zh": "{$P$}，可以让我去一趟商店街吗？我想买些食材。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e11507a1330e0658061cb1c530af959b64ec2e3b3bc90497432d92f5c12c73cf", "ja": "うん？　構わないけど……食材って、どうするんだ？", "zh": "嗯？可以是可以……不过买食材是要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "aa83d913551421721c8f77e364c822ce8b26c50415d323f734e9c4ee68317623", "ja": "ええと……実は私、料理スキルを結構上げていて。\nライブのお客さんに、何か作って配ろうと思って。", "zh": "那个……其实我的厨艺已经提高了不少。\n我想做点什么分给来看演出的客人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "2e08a8d9521cc2524961d4bfbeefbfe5021c87f6d9ef55f6e6dd143a0b339843", "ja": "劇場のライブでも、たまにあるじゃないですか？\nバレンタインにチョコレートを配ったり。", "zh": "剧场的演出中，也偶尔会有这种事吧？\n比如在情人节分发巧克力什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "349bef25b9a14599a60ab97265c62426bc1022872fe14cb05ca4a27c98eac2a8", "ja": "ああ、ファンサービスってことか。\nいいと思うけど、どんなものを作るんだ？", "zh": "啊，是说粉丝服务吧。\n我觉得不错，不过要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "c3f96a243ad9c8497ad980ec2bf1c13a85225f9a4923cd629e2dafea5b67afa2", "ja": "ちょっとしたお菓子みたいな、軽めのものを……。\nサンドイッチとかですね。", "zh": "像小点心一样的轻食……\n比如三明治之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab117a2913dc0539a0b5e56f28c90bc4ad810f31baefc4e558ef5e87fae5526a", "ja": "本当は、もっと豪華な料理もできるんですけど。\n素材を集めるのが大変なので。", "zh": "其实，我也会做更豪华的料理。\n只是收集食材很费工夫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bad84e2bbfc8119292635a0a7d9a84878826e01c68d240737ee127f5c53671a2", "ja": "なるほど……。\n豪華な料理は、それ相応の手間が掛かるわけだ。", "zh": "原来如此……。\n豪华料理果然需要相应的工夫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "64300fb8fd46bbb2e6567b5c503aaf5b8eb113c4017245a2a97639d0945d2b64", "ja": "はい。そういうのは、今から取り掛かっても\n間に合わないと思いますから。簡単なレシピにします。", "zh": "是的。那种料理就算现在开始做，我觉得也来不及了。所以还是做简单的菜谱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c964c8d7a2ed18c2ca0157e7c923ef4979031ee1815a05a60784f90037862825", "ja": "そんなところまでリアルなんだな。\n食べると、ちゃんと味も感じるらしいし。", "zh": "连这种地方都做得这么逼真啊。听说吃下去后，真的能感受到味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "359f5536a991ba61f6aeeeb5a617311d29f6dbff7792f1527898e9324f4e75b5", "ja": "はい、味も、匂いも……食感もあります。\nここがゲームの世界だって、忘れそうになるくらい。", "zh": "是的，味道、气味……连口感都有。\n真实到让人差点忘了这里是游戏世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1015_p", "source_sha256": "18015859f4beef8e453f5497ca04628bcfdbf8a83678c1fb23e9cbe04558ef76", "ja": "うーん……そこまで言われると、\nちょっと気になるな。食べてみたくなってきた。", "zh": "嗯……你都这么说了，\n我还真有点在意起来了。也开始想尝尝看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "c8b3385d87491c94665cd72648b502c8afcac45fba620e855654a4a66bd1422a", "ja": "あの、せっかくだから、食べてみますか？\nゲームの中の、手料理……。私の。", "zh": "那个，难得有这个机会，要不要尝尝看？\n游戏里的亲手料理……我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3d1e11dfd63f9b1815cb64b0ef3cc270a780d5217e49d1105d183b99c602e6e7", "ja": "えっ、いいのか？　でも時間がかかるんじゃ……？", "zh": "诶，真的可以吗？不过不会要花很长时间吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "e1860fc55ae94f859ad6547c9c7736cc981841d1c906918b9e81f4a34a8624fe", "ja": "いえ、簡単な食材ならアイテムストックの中にたくさん\nありますから！　平気です！　すぐできます！", "zh": "不会，要是简单食材的话，道具库存里多得是！\n没事的！很快就能做好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1020_p", "source_sha256": "81f233c51e3b03656e0b9742f5fd8adde7f4b692a15f1289c168534743f3ede6", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nじゃあ、せっかくだから……いただこうかな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n那既然你这么说……我就恭敬不如从命了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "000324a566e91856614264b7791371052d1ca8051a524de4d9d35686a7f82608", "ja": "ありがとうございますっ。じゃあ、キッチンが使える\nところに行きましょう♪　そこでちゃんと料理して……", "zh": "太感谢了。那我们去能用厨房的\n地方吧♪　到了之后好好做一顿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "535ba1f8d1a0c3d3aae1618432758cea6fab70f92efb7e5faa0899d6dbc6952a", "ja": "あ、献立はどうしよう？\nえっと、レシピ、レシピ……。", "zh": "啊，菜单该怎么办呢？\n呃，菜谱、菜谱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0274_1023_p", "source_sha256": "13e0f2aa4a3b35682c46c567d554185055c810a33dbc47f0a45e022cfd7967a1", "ja": "（買い出しの前に、料理の味見をすることになった。\n……まあ、お客さんに配るなら、必要……かな？）", "zh": "（在采购之前，决定先尝尝料理的味道。……不过，要是要分给客人的话，应该还是有必要的……吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
